{
  "message": "I checked “Sprint 4”, but its photograph and linked film show neither gameplay nor test results. Across these four weeks, you completed reference tasks, but the reported islands, tides and co-op remained unverified. The playable-slice goal was missed because no accessible build or five-player notes supported those reports. This is a common gap that the next checkpoint can address. Start there by sharing a rough playable build and notes showing what five players tested and learned. I look forward to following that playable core through your devlogs and artifacts next checkpoint ;).",
  "agreed": []
}

